# template: The notes of a GitHub release. scripts/release.sh replaces @BRAND_NAME@ and @VERSION@,
# template: puts the version's section of CHANGELOG.md where @NOTES@ stands, and drops these lines.
# template: GitHub shows the result on the release page. Releases are not marked as pre-releases,
# template: because the update feed is the latest release and GitHub's latest skips pre-releases, so
# template: the first line says that the software is early instead.
@BRAND_NAME@ @VERSION@ is early software, so expect rough edges, and please report what you find.

@NOTES@
